                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Listen close, this is the whole tutorial. The Fairy court ahead runs on charm — it shrugs off dragons and laughs at fighters. Poison cuts straight through the glamour: a toxic sting, a sludge wave, anything venomed, and the mist wilts with the court inside it. Steel walls her out too, but venom bites harder. Now — want the practical exam?"
                        }
                    ],
