                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Last gate before Mystic Marsh, trainer. Nobody passes me without one lesson — the one the mist court hopes you never learn."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Titania keeps the Fairy gym past the reeds. Half the trainers on this road walk in swinging dragons and walk out charmed silly. My job is to fix that before the marsh takes you."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My two are venom head to tail. Every sting they land on you today is a sting you can land on her tomorrow. That is the deal at my gate."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Rowan",
                    Label: "default"
                }
